<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! carriage.draft.pulls ~ the pull-into-draft ceremony: a lower bag's tiddler gains a writable copy above it

`lares act lar:///carriage.draft.pulls uri=<uri>` copies a tiddler that currently resolves from a lower bag into a writable draft bag (the active wiki's draft by default, or the bag `to=` names). The source bag stays intact and writes no tombstone; the new copy overlays the original through the composite's priority. Edit the draft, then land it in another bag with a residency action (`lares act lar:///carriage.bag.moves`, `lares act lar:///carriage.bag.copies`).

The verb first asks the vessel which bags hold the tiddler (a title no bag holds answers `not found in any bag` and exits 5), then asks a terminal `Proceed? [y/N]` (a call off a terminal names `yes=true`). The draft rides the door with no verb word: the flag names the pull, and an ACTION verb beside it refuses.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ pull-a-draft · pull-into-a-bag

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`pull-a-draft` params=`draft/true uri/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/example ~ copy the tiddler into the active wiki's draft`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`pull-into-a-bag` params=`draft/true uri/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/example to/lar:///ha.ka.ba/wikis/lares/working ~ copy it into the draft bag named`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ uri · to · yes

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`uri` params=`takes/lar-address needs/required ~ the tiddler to pull, by its lar: address`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`to` params=`takes/bag-uri ~ the draft bag the copy lands in; absent, the active wiki's draft`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`yes` params=`~ the intent a call off a terminal names in place of the y/N a terminal asks`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ write

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`write` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ a write into the draft layer; a terminal asks y/N unless yes=true rides, and a JSON call off a terminal refuses without it`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · not-found

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[carriage.draft.pulls uri/<uri>]] ~ the tiddler's address stands required`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`not-found` params=`~ no bag holds the tiddler; the verb exits 5 and names it`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ drafted · aborted

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`drafted` params=`exit/0 fields/[[tiddler fromBag toBag status receipt]] ~ the copy landed in the draft bag; the source stays intact`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`aborted` params=`exit/0 ~ the person answered no at the prompt`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

